message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Thermal stress and honeybee wing morphology: analysis code and data"
abstract: >-
  Data and complete R and Python analysis pipelines for a common-garden study of
  Apis mellifera wing morphometry in sister broods reared at two developmental
  temperatures (Coyhaique, Chile and Ribeirao Preto, Brazil).
type: software
license: MIT
